````

**Changed files**

- `harness/planner.py` — policy-derived missing inputs (required → material → applicable conditional-material, with the exact pinned `distance_km` condition only; anything else is contract drift → `TerminalError`); transactional exactly-one-match school resolution with staged/committed IDs, preflight recording, explicit-ID bypass and conflict detection; Unicode-safe selector normalization with the single pinned alias (`teaching staff` → `teaching_fte`) and field routing (`metrics`/`ratios`/`grades`) from the registry `metric_list` and the input-catalog schema mapping/enums; a dependency-free draft-2020-12-subset validator over the registered pinned request schemas (registered-path-only loading); VC-POC-09/10 explicit-filter enforcement; and origin-aware `bad_request` handling (caller identity → clarification; otherwise → `TerminalError`).
- `run.py` — the default CLI now calls `converse(None, deps, ...)` and no longer imports or builds the legacy agent; `converse()` retains explicit-agent support; credentials, rendering, exit codes and clarification limits unchanged.
- `tests/unit/test_planner.py` — all named acceptance tests plus transactional-resolution, normalization, exact-request, constraint and error-origin coverage; the obsolete first-match and `bad_request → out_of_scope` tests were replaced.
- `tests/unit/test_intent_boundary.py` — adds `test_planner_failure_is_not_unsupported` and planner-boundary tests (clarification bypasses narration/answer view; exact validated request reaches evidence; unnormalizable metrics and invalid explicit identities stay clarifications).
- `tests/unit/test_run_cli.py` — adds `test_main_uses_pipeline_path_by_default` and a source-level no-legacy-agent check; all legacy-loop tests unchanged.

