ASSISTANT def _find_exclusion_text(excluded_topic: str | None) -> str:
ASSISTANT     """Find the contract exclusion text matching a topic hint.
ASSISTANT 
ASSISTANT     Searches the exclusion texts for a case-insensitive substring match on the
ASSISTANT     mapped keyword, then on the raw hint. Falls back to the first text in sorted
ASSISTANT     order so there is always a contract-text reason (never harness prose).
